Subject: [PATCH] Add 1-stage firmware for ar9170
Date: Thu, 28 May 2009 14:39:55 -0700
Message-ID: <1243546795-11799-1-git-send-email-lrodriguez@atheros.com>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain
Sender: linux-wireless-owner@vger.kernel.org
List-ID: <linux-wireless.vger.kernel.org>

You can now just use one firmware file for ar9170,
the ar9170.fw file. This also adds support for the
AVM FRITZ 11n devices, which need this new firmware.

For people's convenience we also add a ar9170.fw.ihex
in case you want to download the firmware through gitweb.

This firmware is licensed under the same license as ar9170-1.fw
and ar9170-2.fw, see LICENCE.atheros_firmware for details.

